| Situation | Error name | Action |
|---|---|---|
| you called abort(). | AbortError. | ignore. |
| `AbortSignal.timeout(5000)` fired. | TimeoutError. | "Taking too long" message. |
| offline or DNS failure. | TypeError. | report network problem. |
| HTTP 500. | none (ok false). | report server problem. |

